      "tone": "white",
      "kicker": "ഇല",
      "title": "ഓരോ ഇലയും, ശ്രദ്ധയോടെ",
      "body": [
        "A sadhya begins long before the first guest sits down. Rows of banana leaves are laid end to end, and every one waits for the same promise — upperi and pickles at the tip, each curry in its place, rice served hot.",
        "For the families who call us, that long row of leaves is the moment the celebration becomes real. We lay every leaf as if it were the only one."
      ],
      "photo": {
        "src": "stories/leaf-sadhya.webp",
        "alt": "A full Sreekarthika sadhya on banana leaf — curries, pickles, pappadam and payasam in their places",
        "shape": "landscape"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "curries",
      "layout": "split-reverse",
      "tone": "leaf",
      "kicker": "കറികൾ",
      "title": "ഓരോ കറിക്കും അതിന്റെ സമയം",
      "body": [
        "Avial, olan, kaalan, erissery, thoran — every curry has its own rhythm and its own hour on the fire, and every one is cooked in big vessels on the day.",
        "Then our crew carries them down the rows and serves each leaf hot, in its place — what reaches your guests tastes exactly the way it did when it left our stove."
      ],
      "video": {
        "src": "stories/serving.mp4",
        "poster": "stories/serving-poster.webp",
        "alt": "Our crew serving sadhya onto banana leaves, row after row",
        "shape": "portrait"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kitchen",
      "layout": "split",
      "tone": "cream",
      "kicker": "അടുക്കള",
      "title": "അടുക്കളയിൽ നിന്ന് നേരെ ഇലയിലേക്ക്",
      "body": [
        "Before a single leaf is laid, every dish is ready in our kitchen — parippu, pulissery, pachadi, pickles, payasam — each in its own vessel, checked, tasted and packed container after container for the venue.",
        "Nothing is made days ahead and warmed up: the spread is cooked the same day, by the same hands, for your day."
      ],
      "video": {
        "src": "stories/curries.mp4",
        "poster": "stories/curries-poster.webp",
        "alt": "Containers of sadhya curries lined up and packed for a function",
        "shape": "landscape"
      }
    },
